---
import StaticPage from '../layouts/StaticPage.astro';
---

<StaticPage
	title="Contact Us"
	description="Get in touch with the ShiftBackspace team with questions, feedback, corrections, or partnership inquiries."
	icon="📬"
>
	<p>
		We'd love to hear from you — whether it's a question about one of our guides, a correction, a
		topic you'd like us to cover, or a partnership inquiry.
	</p>

	<h2>Email</h2>
	<p>
		The fastest way to reach us is by email:
		<a href="mailto:dorseyhollifield@gmail.com">dorseyhollifield@gmail.com</a>
	</p>
	<p>We try to reply to every message within a few business days.</p>

	<h2>What to include</h2>
	<p>To help us respond faster, please let us know:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>If it's about a specific article or fix, the article title or link</li>
		<li>What device, OS version, or Microsoft product you're using, if relevant</li>
		<li>Whether you're reaching out as a reader, a brand/PR contact, or for something else</li>
		<li>Any details that will help us understand your question or feedback</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>A quick note</h2>
	<div class="note-box warm">
		<span class="note-icon">🚨</span>
		<span>
			ShiftBackspace does not offer personalized one-on-one tech support by email. If you're dealing
			with a critical issue — data loss, a compromised account, or a business-critical system down —
			please contact official Microsoft support or a qualified IT professional directly rather than
			waiting for a reply here.
		</span>
	</div>
</StaticPage>
